+## Exercises {#sec-exercise-tips}
+
+Most chapters end with exercises related to the chapter's topic. Example
+solutions are available in [@sec-example-solutions].
+
+::: {.callout-tip}
+## Tips for exercises
+
+- Add clear comments explaining each line or section of code. This enhances
+understanding for both you and others, aids in debugging, facilitates code
+reuse, and promotes transparency.
+- Interpret results by comparing them to existing literature. Summarize key
+findings to ensure they are easily understandable, even for those without
+advanced expertise in data analytics.
+- Avoid hard-coding values. Instead, define variables at the start of the
+code chunk to make parameter adjustments easier and improve code reusability.
+
+:::
+
